    "custom_liquid_4PhgQT": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .faq-section {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 16px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .faq-title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n  .faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n  .faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n  .faq-question {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: #fff;\n    transition: background 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question {\n    background: #f7f7f7;\n  }\n  .faq-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n  }\n  .faq-icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .faq-question-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 17px);\n    color: #2b2fa3;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question-text {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .faq-chevron {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-chevron {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n  .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;\n    padding: 0 16px 0 52px;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 300px;\n    padding-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 500px) {\n    .faq-answer {\n      padding-left: 40px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-list\">\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">How long until I see results?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Many customers report feeling immediate hydration and softer skin upon the first application. For visible improvements in skin texture, radiance, and the appearance of fine lines, we recommend consistent daily use for at least 30 days to allow your skin cycle to adjust.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Is this safe to use?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes! The Koriderm formula uses purified Centella Asiatica to soothe and support the skin's natural moisture barrier. It is formulated to be gentle and is suitable for most skin types, including sensitive or reactive skin. We always recommend performing a patch test before full use.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Where can I use the Time Reverse cream?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>You can use this cream on the face, neck, and décolletage. It is specifically designed to target areas prone to dryness and fine lines, such as around the eyes, forehead, and mouth. It can also be applied to areas with uneven texture to help smooth the skin's appearance.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Does it have a scent?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>The cream is formulated without added synthetic fragrances. It is nearly odorless, possessing only a very faint, natural scent from the botanical ingredients that dissipates quickly after application.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Do I need other products with this cream?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>This is a multi-action moisturizer designed to hydrate, brighten, and smooth the skin in one step. It works beautifully on its own as a daily moisturizer, but it is also lightweight enough to layer over your favorite serums if you have a multi-step routine.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\" data-link=\"https://koriderm.com/a/account/login\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Manage your subscription</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(q => {\n    q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      const link = this.getAttribute('data-link');\n      if (link) {\n        window.location.href = link;\n        return;\n      }\n      const item = this.parentElement;\n      const wasActive = item.classList.contains('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));\n      if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
